          "snippet": {
            "line": 300,
            "text": "noncomputable def linearEquiv (P : Patch) (b : ℝ) (hb : GoodExponent b) : Coeff ≃L[ℝ] Coeff :=\n  (matrixEquiv P.leftHalf (axialPowers b) (axialPowers_injective b hb)).prodCongr\n    (matrixEquiv P.rightHalf (angularPowers b) (angularPowers_injective b hb))"
